  "content": "\n\n<h1>Aimz - Lunar Arrow RPG 准星</h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">简介</span></p>\n<p>专为我的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包定制的准星。现已作为独立模组发布。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">描述</span></p>\n<p>通过将原版标准准星替换为基于广受欢迎的 Lunar 客户端设计的 PvP 风格箭头准星，进一步提升你的原版游戏体验。非常适合 PvP 环境，在单人游戏或普通服务器中同样适用。</p>\n<p><br>寻找更多准星、字体或资源包？查看我的其他项目 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gamerpotion/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/776/799/2023-12-19_01.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即开通服务器，与好友一同畅玩！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%2fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a> 或下方横幅 &amp; 使用代码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%2fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%2fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
